# Requests for the IDE HTTP client (Visual Studio, Rider, VS Code REST Client).
# Run the API with `dotnet run --project src/DocumentProcessing.Api` (http profile, port 5052),
# or set @host to the "api" endpoint shown in the Aspire dashboard.
# Writes need an access key outside Development: set @apiKey to one of Auth:ApiKeys.

@host = http://localhost:5052
@apiKey = replace-with-an-access-key
@documentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@templateId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Can this caller write? (reads are always public)
GET {{host}}/api/auth/status
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Dashboard metrics
GET {{host}}/api/metrics/dashboard

### List documents (status is optional: Uploaded, Processing, Completed, Failed, NeedsReview, Approved)
GET {{host}}/api/documents?page=1&pageSize=20

### Document detail (extracted fields, OCR text, metrics)
GET {{host}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}

### Download the original file
GET {{host}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}/download

### Upload a document (PDF/JPEG/PNG/TIFF/BMP, max 50 MB; templateId is optional)
POST {{host}}/api/documents/upload?templateId={{templateId}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./sample.pdf
--boundary--

### Correct extracted fields (changes are recorded in the correction log)
PUT {{host}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}/fields
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fields": [
    { "name": "TotalAmount", "value": "48300.00" }
  ]
}

### Approve a document
POST {{host}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}/approve
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Re-run the processing pipeline
POST {{host}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}/reprocess
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### List templates
GET {{host}}/api/templates

### Create a template (the prompt must contain all three placeholders)
POST {{host}}/api/templates
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Purchase Order",
  "description": "Extracts purchase order details",
  "fields": [
    { "name": "PoNumber", "dataType": "String", "isRequired": true, "description": "Purchase order number" },
    { "name": "OrderDate", "dataType": "Date", "isRequired": true, "description": "Date of the order" },
    { "name": "Total", "dataType": "Currency", "isRequired": true, "description": "Order total" }
  ],
  "promptTemplate": "Extract the fields below from this purchase order.\n{fieldDefinitions}\n\nDocument:\n{ocrText}\n\n{outputFormat}"
}

### Delete a template
DELETE {{host}}/api/templates/{{templateId}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
